# Whenever a Pull Request changes any of the files listed below, GitHub
# automatically requests a review from the listed owner(s), and (if their
# GitHub notification settings have email enabled) sends them an email
# saying "your review is requested."
#
# This is the ACTUAL approval gate for production — combined with the
# branch protection rule "Require review from Code Owners" on `main`
# (see README Section 8, Step 7), a PR touching these files literally
# cannot be merged until the listed owner approves it.

# Anything that changes what runs in production
apps/demo-app/values-prod.yaml    @linuxshakil
argocd-apps/environments/prod-app.yaml   @linuxshakil
argocd-projects/prod-project.yaml   @linuxshakil

